Source: National Archives, Nixon Presidential Materials, NSC Files, Box 624,
                    Country Files, Middle East, Pakistan, Vol. III, 1 Oct 70–28 Feb 71. Secret;
                    Exdis. Farland was informed of the President’s decisions on February 5 and
                    instructed to convey them to President Yahya. (Telegram 20428 to Islamabad;
                    ibid., RG 59, Central Files 1970–73, DEF 12–5 PAK)
